`SEALED` is progressing anchor-by-anchor with crash-safe receipts. The first completed anchor now shows 56.98 seconds to the final first-improvement pass and 8.19 seconds for the excluded certificate; its 30.08-second action is already +631.5% over baseline in true 48-boundary efficiency. Timing variation from the pilot is visible, which is why all twenty anchors—not the pilot—will drive the result.
